From fb00b0763c132f79820dfcd3ca0ef0575c131bcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Arruda <pollaris.ncamara@terceiros.mag.com.br>
Date: Mon, 16 Feb 2026 21:39:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: drag-drop conexao/banco cria bloco SQL + conecta sessao

- BlockEditor aceita drop de connection-name e database-name
- Drop cria bloco SQL com conexao/banco pre-configurado
- Object Explorer drag inclui connection_name no mime data
- connection_drop_requested signal conecta sessao via _quick_connect
- Empty state (tela inicial) aceita drop de conexao
- Deteccao nativa de mudanca de banco apos execucao SQL
- Removido dry-run do workflow release.yml

Testes: 52 em test_block_connection.py (150 relacionados passando)
